  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The hometown I had suddenly returned to did not welcome me back. A sudden downpour of rain. An old house with a leaky ceiling. I went to a guest house that towered over the shabby place and asked for help. No, I begged.\n\nI asked for a room from a guesthouse owner, who said he wasn't in business, but I didn't realize at the time that I was about to be pressed into a corner.\n\n\"I know you. You're Ai Ying, Grandma Chunyeo's granddaughter.\"\n\n\"How do you know?\"\n\nSomehow I ended up speaking with him and eating his food, after hearing him mention my grandmother. The more I got to know him, the more I felt an unexplainable emotion.\n\n\"Do you want to sleep with me?\"\n\nI thought I might be at the end of my rope, but being with this man made me hope for more.  And so begins what might be the hottest summer of my life.\n\n[ Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/4941000012[url)",
